    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just not about finding a \"new path.\" that's the thing. it feels like the capacity to even care about a path is gone. i look at the people around me, the people still \"trying,\" and they just seem so delusional. like they're all chasing ghosts. i feel like i've reached the end of the logic, and the logic says there's nothing left here for me. it's not just fatigue, it's like a total void.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
